.claude

# Helm dependency downloads and packaged charts
charts/*/charts/
charts/*/*.tgz
charts/*/Chart.lock

# A bare `test.yaml` rule used to live here, which silently ignored that filename anywhere in the
# repo — including any future chart's tests. Scoped to the one local scratch file it was actually
# hiding. That file holds a real (expired) Azure SAS token and should be deleted; it stays ignored
# until then so scoping this rule cannot accidentally stage a secret.
charts/ontoserver-indexer/examples/test.yaml

.env